Enter the Chef Express world and discover the benefits dedicated to you!

With the new APP you can access all the exclusive services reserved for Chef Express customers from your smartphone.

To start, register and immediately access your personalized loyalty program.

Through our application you can:
- access your virtual card at any time and obtain discounts and promotions reserved for you;
- stay up to date on the status of your profile;
- access the Webcam Park service;
- request the invoice for each transaction;
- find the store closest to you, and be informed about opening hours and services;
- access dedicated promotions;
- access the Booking Groups service to book your group parking in comfort

Download the APP and discover the customized program dedicated to your needs!

The multilingual app for SoftCooker Wi-Food allows to manage this innovative and revolutionary device for SousVide cooking via Bluetooth in a simple and quick way. 

Thanks to this app you can:

- run more units in the same kitchen;
- start a cooking cycle with 4 different temperature/time stages, if needed;
- create and memorize your recipes inside the app and the device to reuse them afterwards;
- share and see the recipes of all the users registered at www.softcooker.com;
- have available a large number of updated recipes on meat, fish, vegetables and fruit, created by the best Chefs; furthermore, with a few clicks you can view the temperature and cooking level for each food and its preparation as well;
- check and follow the cooking cycle easily as it goes on;
- log HACCP of the different cooking cycles.
